<title>USA: Ciampi welcomes Italian bond auction results.</title>
<headline>Ciampi welcomes Italian bond auction results.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Treasury and Budget Minister Carlo Azeglio Ciampi welcomed Monday the results of the first auctions of Italian Treasury securities since last Friday's passage of the budget.</p>
<p>&quot;It went very well,&quot; Ciampi told reporters at the annual meetings of the International Monetary Fund and World Bank.</p>
</text>
